  translation {
    text: "Change\r\nThe weekday, westbound 5:16 p.m. trip departing Civic Center Station will be moved to 5:22 p.m.\r\n\nReason\r\nResolve gate conflict with Route 1 in Gate 7.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 15 respondents, 40% reported a positive impact from the change, 40% indicated it had no impact, and 20% perceived the change negatively."
